flowchart TB
  subgraph mainPath [主路径]
    direction TB
    sendTurn[用户发送一句]
    recordGen[记下这一代正在做]
    readStop[发出前读取停止标记]
    sendModel[未停止就发出请求]
    writeBubble[回答写入当前气泡]
    finishTurn[这一代正常结束]
    pad[" "]
    sendTurn --> recordGen
    recordGen --> readStop
    readStop --> sendModel
    sendModel --> writeBubble
    writeBubble --> finishTurn
    finishTurn --> pad
  end
  skipSend[已经停止就不发请求]
  cannotPull[已经发出的请求不能撤回]
  dropLate[迟到文字不写入气泡]
  skipMemory[已经停止就不写长期记忆]
  keepEvent[已确认的日历保持原样]
  readStop --> skipSend
  sendModel --> cannotPull
  writeBubble --> dropLate
  finishTurn --> skipMemory
  skipMemory --> keepEvent
  classDef hide fill:#ffffde,stroke:#ffffde,color:#ffffde
  class pad hide
  linkStyle 5 stroke:#ffffde,fill:#ffffde
